# Generated data goes to cuadmm_outdir() (default <tempdir>/cuadmm), never here.
# These are a backstop for when CUADMM_OUT points inside this folder (at any
# depth -- hence unanchored) or an experiment writes from an old layout. One
# baseline run wrote ~1.9 GB of dumps.
baseline/
dumps/
bisect/
cu_*/
cvt_test/
*.mat
search2d_rows.txt
*.asv
# results/2026-09-24/ IS tracked: the measured tables and logs behind BASELINE_REPORT.md.
!results/**
